    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Monique",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110225607137410458699/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJu12r4SBWg77tp5auQhPNlKqve8uIgtEp8hU5qc2eGCYPBtg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Amazing dentist and fabulous staff, they make going to the dentist a pleasant experience.  Very knowledgeable, competent, respectful and gentle.\nCould not ask for more.  Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1765151273,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Cathie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106296338180710109628/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWIY8pibTgWX3bzqGT4jMfNd7k1v8ZJpfCVg4XG4mEEb8Xixkt=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "After having read the reviews for this Dental Clinic I decided to give the clinic a try. (Going to the dentist is not something I enjoy ☺️).  The staff were warm and welcoming and work to reduce your anxiety.  As a result, I’ve been back a few times and no longer dread going to the dentist 😁.  I highly recommend this clinic.",
        "time": 1762035991,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nicolas G.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103521018403691589419/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXuZffi_dzOxrectJ9i_QSWeHFW3YJMf43qPD25n1V50PCBXZRa=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Absolutely Outstanding Dental Care at Passion Sourire!\n\nI’ve been going to Passion Sourire and couldn’t be more impressed with the level of care and professionalism. From the moment you arrive, the staff makes you feel welcome — they’re super nice, genuinely caring, and always make the experience comfortable.\n\nAppointments are usually right on time, and the wait is minimal, which is a big plus. The clinic itself is clean, modern, and located in a very convenient area with lots of free parking available.\n\nDr. Awad is truly exceptional. She takes the time to explain everything in detail, making sure you understand all your options and feel completely at ease before any procedure. She’s incredibly gentle — I’ve never felt any pain during my visits. Even when she lets you know something might cause a bit of discomfort, it somehow never does. She’s a total pro and it really shows!\n\nI’m beyond satisfied with Dr. Awad and the entire team at Passion Sourire. I wouldn’t hesitate to recommend them to anyone looking for top-quality, compassionate dental care.",
        "time": 1752773913,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dana Al Rifai",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112751923448436869408/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWPBL_5YcG71oNg6TJYtpiCH78uP8yAnak2V_do6UW-CdmNbJw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "This is the best dental clinic in Vaudreuil,  probably in Montreal.\nFrom the very moment you enter the clinic, you get a warm welcome.  The staff is friendly and well experienced (Secretaries, dentist assistants and dentists).\nBefore every appointment they check with my insurance the coverage and let me know, before we proceed with the treatment.\nThey never push people into doing extra unnecessary treatments,  unlike a lot of other highly rated clinics who always tried pushing me into doing unnecessary treatments just to make more money.\nSpecial thanks to Dr. Nikol, she's fantastic, well-informed and professional.",
        "time": 1704580896,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "shawna mackinnon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106189787995295365038/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXAtN1raZmWad7kyBVE3GcRicZba7jHm88YdR05gJ2jLV_nAKc3GA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Dr amassian is an absolute gem.\nI don't trust anyone else.\nHe truly cares about his patients. Listens. And really treats you as you're part of his family.",
        "time": 1733951234,
        "translated": false
      }
